 },
 "summary": "CMI3216 parts are 3.2 × 1.6 mm (1206) surface-mount inductors built as a stack of pure-silver inner electrode layers inside a Ni-Cu-Zn ferrite body, with silver terminations plated nickel then tin. The range covers 0.047 µH to 100 µH in 41 values, in a 0.9 mm thick body (321609) up to 39 µH and a 1.1 mm thick body (321611) from 47 µH. Rated current falls from 300 mA at the lowest values to 5 mA at 15 µH and above, and DC resistance rises from 0.15 Ω to 3.00 Ω max. CMI321609U4R7KT is 4.7 µH ±10%, 25 mA, 0.65 Ω max; CMI321609X100KT is 10 µH ±10%, 25 mA, 0.80 Ω max.",
